			"notes": "### REMOVE YOUR OLD CONFIGURATION FILES BECAUSE THE CONFIG IS CHANGED GREATLY, NOT DOING SO MAY RESULT IN CRASHES.\n- Huge Code Refactor\n- New HUD: Day Counter, and Status Effect HUD (See image below)\n  \n  ![Status Effect HUD](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9f8ca5ca8d6c12626a9919212e2d7fe78532d0bb.gif)\n- New Conditional Setting: You can modify the HUD based on the given conditions (ex: when Boss Bar is Shown). This allow you to either completely disable the rendering or just move the HUD away when a condition is met.\n\n  ![Conditions](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/890b483350a16cfc656d58d2c60bb8d745aa4226.png)\n- Option to use number Durability instead of bars. \n  \n  ![Durability Number and Bars](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c25a1257df3b92de47e59b6f1095d6f810b5457b.png)\n\nTesting has been done but does not cover most areas. So do please report any silly occurences to issues."
		},
